APPENDIX G: Food Safety & Regulatory Compliance

Applicable Standards:

· UL 1026 – Electric Household Cooking and Food Preparation Appliances (USA)
· EN 60335‑2‑9 / CE Marking (EU)
· FDA 21 CFR 177.2600 – Food‑contact silicone and PP
· FCC Part 15B – Radio emissions (Wi‑Fi / BLE)

HACCP Considerations (simplified):

· The appliance has no permanent food‑contact surface; the capsule is the sole food pathway.
· Critical control points are limited to capsule manufacturing (seal integrity, nitrogen flush) and storage (ambient ≤25 °C).
· Allergen information carried by capsule RFID and displayed on app; conflict alerts triggered automatically.
· Acrylamide risk: browning controller defaults to light‑medium; “dark toast” requires explicit user consent via app, documented in the session log.

